  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar STET Online Form 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-17T17:25:48+05:30\">August 17, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">5:25 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://secondary.biharboardonline.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bihar</a><a href=\"https://secondary.biharboardonline.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> School Examination Board (BSEB)</a>,</strong> has released a <strong>notification </strong>on its <strong>official website</strong>\u00a0for the examination of <strong>Bihar State Teacher Eligibility Test (BSTET/ STET 2026)</strong><strong>.</strong> The\u00a0<strong>BSEB</strong> application form will start on<strong> 17 August 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"573\">31 August 2026</strong>. Candidates must check the <strong>complete details</strong> for the <strong>Bihar STET Online Form 2026</strong> given below. <strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. P.R.183/2026</span>)</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 1